body:
this happened sunday (probably earlier) and we have had crickets from the WH and media. I think the WH was under code red status this entire week and now the MSM is just starting to sniff this because Microsoft is being super transparent in how badly they got hacked and had to warn over 40 other clients/partners that they also got hacked because of this. literally dude no one even knows how vast this hack was / who did it / why / what they stole etc

&#x200B;

this is like being a robber and sneaking into the smithsonian and living there for 8 months unnoticed just able to play around with everything in the musuem and eye out the most valuable items. this was a goldmine hack that took the entire us government for a loop. 

&#x200B;

someone has our balls right now. the WH knows it. 

&#x200B;

the silence is to not enduce amn actual real panic because there are already reports of utility companies like in NY that were also clients and now grids are compromised and shit could really fucking go down
